The Statistics page displays information such as the highest [[Revolution|Score]] reached and game completion percentage. It contains 4 tabs: '''Global''', '''{{Keyword|inf|Infinity}}''', '''{{Keyword|eternity|Eternity}}''' and '''{{Keyword|unity|Unity}}'''. 

== Global ==
[[File:Statistics Global.png|thumb|Global Page]]

The first being the global page with 4 sections of information:

* The first section is all about how long you've played the game, displaying your playtime, total time, unscaled playtime, and unscaled total time. 
* The second one shows the game completion progress, number of achievements you got, including Normal and Secret.
* The third one shows the statistics, consists of Ascension Power, Lap Speed Mult and Game Speed Mult.
* On the right of these global stats. It shows the highest point you get, you can see your highest score, infinities, IPs, EPs, Eternities and Unities.
*The final section of global page, is your total rank score this will affect your place on the global leaderboard, you can find more information about it here [[leaderboard]].

== [[File:Icon tab inf.png|30x30px]] {{Keyword|inf|Infinity}} ==
[[File:Statistics Infinity.png|thumb|Infinity Page]]
The Infinity page will show all of your Infinity stats, including: 
* The last 10 Infinity runs on the right
* The time before you Infinite
* The unscaled time in this Infinity
* The fastest Infinity you made
* The sum of all ICs time
* Total score
* The best IP you got

== [[File:Icon tab etern.png|30x30px]] {{Keyword|eternity|Eternity}} ==
[[File:Statistics Eternity.png|thumb|Eternity Page]]
The Eternity page will show all of your Eternity stats, including: 
* The last 10 Eternity runs on the right
* The time before you Eternate
* The unscaled time in this Eternity
* The fastest Eternity you made

== [[File:Icon tab unity.png|30x30px]] {{Keyword|unity|Unity}} ==
[[File:Statistics Unity.png|thumb|Unity Page]]
The Unity page will show all of your Unity stats, including: 
* Time in this Unity
* Time last Unity
* Unscaled time in this Unity
* The fastest Unity you made
* Max score in this Unity
* Number of sacrificed Zodiacs
* Total devil bonus for swords, wand, pentacles and cups
* Max Infeccted in Universe Stage
* Max ER level you can craft
* The total of your singularities
* Max Atoms
* Last 10 Unity runs, with zodiac information on the right

